{
  "$comment": "Error normalization (方案 §6.4 + E-41). classify({http, body, nRequested}) → one closed kind. provenance captured = real response from P0 (see image_response_samples.v1); doc_shape = shape from the provider docs or from a P0 observation whose raw body was not archived — replace with a captured body when one shows up, never edit the expected kind to make a parser pass. Order: HTTP class first (401/403 auth, 402 balance, 404 model gone, 429 rate limit unless the body carries balance text, >=500 / <200 / 3xx upstream_error), then every other 4xx (400, 408, 409, 413, 422 ...) by string error.code (numeric codes ignored) / balance text (else invalid_param), then 2xx bodies (MiniMax numeric base_resp.status_code, Gemini non-empty promptFeedback.blockReason, zero images → candidates[0].finishReason (candidates must be an array) block reasons or failed_count > 0 → refused, else decode_failed; fewer than requested → partial; more than requested → ok). Balance text = /insufficient[_ ](?:quota|balance)|余额不足|额度不足/i matched ASCII-case-insensitively (no Unicode case folding) against every string value of the parsed body, recursing into objects and arrays, keys excluded; a body that is not JSON is passed as its raw text string. failed_count counts only as a JSON number or an all-digit string. A single failure never delists a model. timeout / network / storage_full are decided by the transport and storage layers, not by a body, and have no body cases. Executable reference: scripts/lib/studio-image-reference.mjs classifyResult.",
  "contractId": "image_error_samples.v1",
  "version": 1,
  "kinds": {
    "refused": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "rewrite_prompt_or_switch_model"
    },
    "auth": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "check_key"
    },
    "insufficient_balance": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "top_up_or_switch_model"
    },
    "rate_limited": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "retry_later"
    },
    "invalid_param": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "show_raw_and_switch_model",
      "report": true
    },
    "model_unavailable": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "switch_model"
    },
    "upstream_error": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "retry"
    },
    "timeout": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "retry"
    },
    "network": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": "once_before_body_sent",
      "ui": "retry"
    },
    "partial": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": "by_delivered_count",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "fill_missing"
    },
    "decode_failed": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": false,
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "retry",
      "report": true
    },
    "storage_full": {
      "consumesFreeQuota": "already_settled",
      "autoRetry": false,
      "ui": "free_space_then_retry_save"
    }
  },
